<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel upped to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel upped to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Erika Klauer upgraded Intel Corp to strong buy from hold, according to her office.</p>
<p>-- raised her earnings estimate to $9 per share from $7.77 for 1997, and to $11 from $7.75 for 1998, her office said.</p>
<p>-- said the stock has an upside potential to $165 in the next six to 12 months.</p>
<p>-- Intel shares closed at 130-3/8 Thursday.</p>
</text>
